# Security

See also: `docs/007_AUTHENTICATION.md`, `docs/008_PERMISSION.md`

## AuthN

- Supabase Auth only for end users
- Server clients via `@supabase/ssr` patterns (when wired)
- Service role key never ships to the browser

## AuthZ

- Enforce at UI (hide), API (guard), and DB (RLS)
- Read role from server `profiles` — ignore client role claims
- Ownership: buyers see own RFQs/orders; suppliers see invited RFQs + own quotes
- Role matrix source: `docs/008_PERMISSION.md` / `types/roles.ts`

## Secrets

- Store in Vercel / GitHub Actions / Supabase secrets
- Never commit `.env` with real keys
- Rotate on leak suspicion

## AI safety

- AI agent must not silently place binding orders
- Confirm before mutating RFQ/order state
- Audit tool actions; rate-limit prompts
